Z||000000||avengador1||10-30-2001||09:13 PM||||Has anyone thought about using a rotary (Wankel) engine? I understand that the last year RX-7 had over 300 H.P. in a very compact engine. How hard would it be to convert one of these to fit the stock Getrag 5 speed? Any comments will be welcomed.||||reg||7
Z||000001||tgowens||10-31-2001||02:20 AM||||Funny that this subject would come up....... I had a conversation with a man in Salinas, CA who is on the SCCA circuit racing Mazdas and he wants to do just that - put a rotary engine in a Fiero. He is supposed to be coming in to the shop this week and if so, I will get more info for you and/or put you two in touch with each other.....<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.whgraphics.com" TARGET=_blank>West Highland Graphics & Design</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>Classic Fiero Owners Group International</A>||||reg||1
