Z||000003||GarethWright||10-31-2001||03:29 AM||||The RX-7 Rotary has 2 rotors, Mazda has some car(name slips my mind) that isn't imported to the US that has a 3 Rotor engine.  I remember seeing an article where an RX-7 owner had put the tri-rotor in and was amazed at that power of it.  Maybe the 3-rotor could fit in a Fiero?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
